---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Tree Plantation & Free Eye Checkup Camp" description="Sarvagun Society's tree plantation drives and free eye checkup camps in government schools of Uttarakhand.">
  <section class="py-16 lg:py-24">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-[var(--spacing-page)] px-4 lg:px-6">
      <h1 class="text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-heading font-bold mb-6">Tree Plantation &amp; Free Eye Checkup Camp</h1>
      <div class="space-y-10">
        <div>
          <h2 class="font-heading font-bold text-2xl mb-4 text-primary">Tree Plantation Program in Schools</h2>
          <p class="text-text-muted leading-relaxed">Sarvagun Society continues to organize tree plantation camps in various government schools of nearby villages on the occasion of national festivals. The motto behind these programs is to make children and people aware of the worsening conditions of the environment and global warming.</p>
          <p class="text-text-muted leading-relaxed mt-3">By now, the society has successfully completed the plantation of <strong>100 trees</strong> and is planning to do much more to spread awareness about environmental protection.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h2 class="font-heading font-bold text-2xl mb-4 text-primary">Free Eye Checkup Camp</h2>
          <p class="text-text-muted leading-relaxed">Recently, The Sarvagun Society with the help of <strong>The Ramakrishna Mission Ashram</strong> organized a free eye checkup camp in the Government Junior High School and Government Primary School of Malsi and Bhitarli.</p>
          <p class="text-text-muted leading-relaxed mt-3">In this camp, more than <strong>90 students' eyes were tested</strong>. Those found short-sighted were given free spectacles, and those detected with other eye diseases were given free treatment at the Ramkrishna Mission Ashram's charitable dispensary.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
